e identically.\n\nNow write it.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I've got the full picture. The current `apply_batch` mutates the input dict in place and doesn't validate anything — no atomicity (partial writes persist on error), no rejection of unknown ops, negative/zero/non-integer amounts, or missing keys on `"}]}}
